OL,3,GNEWSAChildren in Wales with allergies
OL,4,Amore at risk than in England,
OL,5,Acampaigners say
OL,6,
OL,7,FParents of children with allergies are
OL,8,Furging the Welsh government to adopt a
OL,9,F"life-saving" law to make allergy
OL,10,Fawareness training a requirement in all
OL,11,Fschools.
OL,13,FThe first phase of Benedict's Law,
OL,14,Frequiring schools in England to follow
OL,15,Fstrengthened allergy guidelines and
OL,16,Fstore adrenalin pens on site, came into
OL,17,Feffect earlier this month.
OL,19,FBut the law does not apply in Wales,
OL,20,Fand a campaigner has said children
OL,21,F"should not be put more at risk" than
OL,22,Ftheir peers in England.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
