OL,3,GNEWSAChildren in Wales with allergies
OL,4,Amore at risk than in England,
OL,5,Acampaigners say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Welsh government said it was
OL,8,Freviewing "existing statutory guidance"
OL,9,Ffor schools and would "consider
OL,10,FBenedict's Law to inform future policy
OL,11,Fin Wales".
